'''Pokédex''' (Japanese: '''ポケモン図鑑''' ''Pokémon Illustrated Encyclopedia'') is an {{TCGP|Item}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Promo-A}} series of cards.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Item
|rule=SWSH Item
|effect=Look at the top 3 cards of your deck.
}}

==Release information==
The {{TCGP|Promo-A}} (004/P-A) print of this card was first made available to purchase from the in-game {{TCGP|shop}} on October 30, 2024 worldwide (September 26, 2024 in New Zealand) for 2 Shop Tickets each. One copy of this print is also awarded to players who complete the {{TCGP|Mission|mission}} "10: Retreat!" in the {{DL|Mission (TCG Pocket)|Battle Guide}}.

The Promo-A (008/P-A) print of this card was released as an in-game gift to players between January 20, 2025 and April 30, 2025 in celebration of Pokémon Trading Card Pocket players collecting a total of 40 billion cards worldwide. Players who logged in to the game between these dates were given 30 days to redeem the card as a gift.

