==Trivia==
* This card's effect is similar to that of the {{TCG|Pokédex}} card in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]], but only allows the player to look at 3 cards instead of 5, and does not allow them to change the cards' order.

===Origin===
* A [[Pokédex]] is a tool for recording information about Pokémon species in the [[Pokémon games]]. This card's illustrations depict the HANDY909 model, seen in {{game|FireRed and LeafGreen|s}}.

